---
source: crates/orbit/src/app/cli_args.rs
expression: output
---
Create and start containers on the Docker host.

Usage: orbit up [FLAGS] [SERVICES]…

Arguments:
  [SERVICES]…  Services to start.

               Default: every service

Flags:
  -d, --detach          Run containers in the background.
      --force-recreate  Recreate containers even if their configuration is
                        unchanged.
      --pull <PULL>     Pull images before starting.
                        [possible values: always, missing, never]
  -h, --help            Print help
